{"kind": "mod", "id": 1502, "name": "HD Vanilla Trader Pics", "slug": "hd-vanilla-trader-pics", "teaser": "Higher resolution vanilla trader pictures.", "owner_name": "redlaser42", "downloads": 7078, "favourites": 1, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": true, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:02:59.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-06-24T17:42:13.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-06-24T17:42:13.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.8.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Why?</strong></p>\n<p>The trader pictures were distractingly low rez. I did not like the other alternate trader picture mods. I wanted to keep true to the original design, so I took the original pictures and ran them through various upscalers and face generators, then a lot of clean up in Photoshop.</p>\n<p>Now you can see everyone up close. The changes are subtle, but they give them a lot more character.</p>\n<p>I recommend using this with my other mod <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2096-hide-top-glow/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Hide Top Glow</a>, otherwise Ragman and Jager will look too bright.</p>\n<p><strong>After installing, you must “Clear Temp Files” in the SPT launcher for the new pictures to show up.</strong></p>\n<p>(Those original pictures in the corners are a true size comparison. (127x127 -&gt; 526x526 )</p>\n<p>Credit to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/163-alternative-trader-pics/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Alternative Trader Pics</a> for the code. You do not need this as a prerequisite though.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.4.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 448, "published_at": "2024-07-08T19:10:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1502/hd-vanilla-trader-pics/1.4.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.6.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1477, "published_at": "2024-11-26T19:06:33.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1502/hd-vanilla-trader-pics/1.6.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.7.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1182, "published_at": "2025-03-17T15:34:19.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1502/hd-vanilla-trader-pics/1.7.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.8.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1505, "published_at": "2025-05-31T00:03:58.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1502/hd-vanilla-trader-pics/1.8.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": [], "source_code_links": [], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": true, "obtainable": false, "dep_problems": 0}